### 4.1 Core Formulas

| # | Symbol | LaTeX |
|---|--------|-------|
| 1 | Contrastive InfoNCE loss (image→text) | $$\mathcal{L}_\text{I\!\rightarrow\!T}= -\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\log\frac{\exp\big(\mathbf{v}_i^\top\mathbf{t}_i/\tau\big)}{\sum_{j=1}^{N}\exp\big(\mathbf{v}_i^\top\mathbf{t}_j/\tau\big)}$$ |
| 2 | Symmetric loss (text→image) | Same formula with **v** and **t** swapped; total loss is the sum of the two. |
| 3 | Projection heads | $$\mathbf{v}=W_{v}\,\phi_{\text{vis}}(\mathbf{x}),\qquad \mathbf{t}=W_{t}\,\phi_{\text{txt}}(\mathbf{c})$$ |

