| 1 | `model.py` | `ClipLoss.forward` – computes `logits_per_image` and `logits_per_text`, then uses `nn.CrossEntropyLoss`. |
| 2 | Same file | The loss is computed twice (image‑to‑text + text‑to‑image) and summed. |
