## 5️⃣ Finite Scalar Quantization: VQ‑VAE Made Simple (FSQ)  
*Paper:* `finite_scalar_quantization:_vq-vae_made_simple.tex`  
*Codebase:* `Nikolai10/FSQ` – `/workplace/FSQ`

### 5.1 Core Formulas

| # | Symbol | LaTeX |
|---|--------|-------|
| 1 | Scalar quantizer per channel | $$\hat{z}_c = \arg\min_{k\in\{1,\dots,K\}}\big|z_c - s_c^{(k)}\big|$$ |
| 2 | Distortion‑rate objective | $$\mathcal{L}_\text{FSQ}= \underbrace{\|\mathbf{x}-\hat{\mathbf{x}}\|_2^2}_{\text{reconstruction}} + \lambda\, H(\hat{\mathbf{z}})$$ where \(H\) is the empirical entropy of the quantized codes. |
| 3 | Straight‑through gradient (same as VQ‑VAE) | $$\frac{\partial \hat{z}}{\partial z}\approx 1$$ |

